Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.67,VO,,0,0,0,,THURSDAY NIGHT. I HAD MY
Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.67,0:00:02.65,VO,,0,0,0,,BEST HAUNTING PLANNED
Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.65,0:00:04.05,VO,,0,0,0,,YET. THEN I HEARD HIM
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.05,0:00:05.26,VO,,0,0,0,,THROUGH HIS BEDROOM DOOR.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.46,0:00:07.02,MAX,,0,0,0,,HEY. SO. DO YOU
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.02,0:00:07.60,MAX,,0,0,0,,WANT TO GO TO
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.60,0:00:09.15,MAX,,0,0,0,,THE HALLOWEEN DANCE WITH ME?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.22,0:00:10.83,MAX,,0,0,0,,NO. TOO SERIOUS.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.19,0:00:15.78,MAX,,0,0,0,,YO! DANCE? YOU? ME? UGH. NO.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.85,0:00:18.76,MAX,,0,0,0,,OKAY. THIS WEEKEND, I JUST ASK HER.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.99,0:00:21.48,MAX,,0,0,0,,WHAT'S THE WORST SHE CAN SAY? GROSS?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.87,0:00:23.36,SKYE,,0,0,0,,WHO IS HE ASKING?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.48,0:00:25.75,SKYE,,0,0,0,,WHO WOULD EVEN SAY YES TO HIM?
